    <!-- Help & FAQ -->
    <string name="faq_q1">How does ScanOff work?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Select the apps you want to block and start the pause. The apps are only released again once you scan your personal QR code.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">Why do I need the accessibility service?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">The accessibility service detects when a blocked app is opened and then shows the pause screen. No content is read or stored.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">What happens if I lose my QR code?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Without the matching QR code, the pause can\'t be ended – that\'s intentional. So save or print your code in a safe place.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">Can I generate a new QR code?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Yes, via \"Manage QR code\" → \"Create new QR code\". The old code becomes invalid immediately.</string>

